      ]
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "logueTarget": {
      "module": "modfx"
    },
    "unitName": "LP FreqShift"
  },
  "notes": "A stereo frequency shifter: every partial moves by the same number of Hz, for metallic, inharmonic sounds. TIME = shift (zero at the middle), DEPTH = feedback. SPREAD sends the right side the other way (50 = ring modulation). A few Hz at MIX 50 is a barber-pole phaser."
}
